Package: haltia-video
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
 python3-haltia-kit (>= 2.2.0), python3-pil, python3-qrcode, mpv, ffmpeg
Description: YouTube and VK Video in large cards, simply
 Видео (Video) finds videos on YouTube and VK Video, follows channels and
 shows their new videos together, with the history of what was watched and
 where it stopped; mpv plays them. Signing in brings the accounts'
 subscriptions and recommendations. Part of Haltia, a calm touch desktop; it
 runs on any GTK desktop.
 .
 It carries its own yt-dlp and QuickJS, newer than the distribution's,
 which YouTube needs.
